<p>A well-trained AI chatbot answers reader questions, captures emails, and keeps visitors on your site longer — all without a support team. The tools in this category let you train a chatbot on your own content and embed it on your site in minutes.</p>

<ul>
<li><strong><a href="/reviews/fastbots-ai-review/">FastBots.ai</a></strong> — Train a chatbot on your website content, PDFs, or text. Deploy across web, WhatsApp, Messenger, and Instagram. Free plan available (25 messages/month). Best for: affiliate sites wanting a content-trained chatbot with multi-channel deployment.</li>
<li><strong><a href="/reviews/chatbase-review/">Chatbase</a></strong> — AI customer service platform with lead capture, task automation, and multi-channel deployment. Free plan available (30 messages/month). Best for: businesses needing both chatbot Q&A and automated support workflows.</li>
