<ul>
<li><strong><a href="/reviews/seo-writing-ai-review/">SEO Writing AI</a></strong> — Purpose-built for search-optimised articles. Generates outlines, drafts, and meta descriptions from a single keyword with built-in SERP analysis, NLP content scoring, and WordPress auto-publishing. Free plan (3 articles). Best for: affiliate marketers publishing 3–5 articles per week who need consistent, rank-optimised output.</li>
<li><strong><a href="/blog/how-to-write-seo-content-with-ai/">How to Write SEO Content With AI</a></strong> — Step-by-step workflow guide. Covers choosing the right writing tool, building a repeatable process, editing AI output for human readers, and post-writing SEO optimisation.</li>
