<ul>
<li><strong><a href="/reviews/surfer-seo-review/">Surfer SEO</a></strong> — AI-powered content optimisation that scores your draft against top-ranking pages. Integrates with SEO Writing AI for an end-to-end content+optimisation workflow. Plans from $49/month. Best for: content creators who have a draft ready and need to optimise it for search.</li>
<li><strong><a href="/reviews/semrush-review/">Semrush</a></strong> — All-in-one SEO suite with AI content tools, keyword research, competitor analysis, site auditing, and rank tracking. Plans from $139/month. Best for: serious affiliate marketers managing multiple sites who need comprehensive SEO data, not just content optimisation.</li>
</ul>
